物，并且受到的一击伤害不会超过最大生命值的 %d%%。\n\t\t#{italic}#用死亡链锯拆了他们的骨头！！#{normal}#"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"b300e3fdce0b083ff6cb52cb1381658a8153eddb0fc29873488d019a63fae38b","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"4616db475118b0fcfc44b78adeea77ce35629169f4cffbeb662edd2372f8d0ee","logical_entry_identity":"456c2793656487304e886e9a19206957af363543b5f90b23a65f6a9c6545701d","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"Annihilator","source_tag":"birth descriptor name","target":"歼灭者"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"a3bebcd11705f7094627af2491d529a7b7ebd51fb297fa7c1d72616719568154","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"461ab2185c452cff1f1d499a7e6dc0a89c780ce972b7c8aebac4d14beea523ef","logical_entry_identity":"1676e8671e780ab83c4a67a2d95f7454aa90bee518321ccc41ee24ca244c750f","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"You load advanced grenades into your launcher.\n\tIncendiary Grenade: Deals fire damage over 3 turns, increasing damage taken by %d%%.\n\tChemical Grenade: Deals acid damage and slows targets by %d%% for 3 turns.\n\tShock Grenade: Deals lightning damage and shocks targets for %d turns, reducing stun and pin resistance by 50%%.\n\tIn addition, your turrets now explode when destroyed, dealing %0.2f physical damage to enemies in radius 3.\n\tYou can only choose a single type of grenade at a time.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你往你的发射器内装入高级榴弹。\n\t\t燃烧榴弹：在 3 回合内造成火焰伤害，增加所受到的伤害 %d%%。\n\t\t化学榴弹：造成酸性伤害，减速目标 %d%%，持续 3 回合。\n\t\t震荡榴弹：造成闪电伤害，震撼目标 %d 回合，使目标震慑和定身抗性减少50%%。\n\t\t另外，你的炮台被摧毁的时候会引发爆炸，对半径 3 码内的敌人造成 %0.2f 物理伤害。\n\t\t你只能同时激活一种榴弹类型。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"e22d7f81982eff1f63b5e9ab6e78385630eb3673ae5c404c53ddfe385ca1dc4f","component":"orcs","entry_revision_identity":"4635ffb6fcb49b73b1f33ae3979cd45a1f0771f0dbca926eb26bab469463de51","logical_entry_identity":"3b31612447e44de0e7d1c3c91cd89c71599539e996a0f759cf18c3df47a0767f","normalized_path":"tome-orcs.lua","source":"You require heavy ammunition and a heavy weapon to use this talent.","sourc